Source: hako-raylib-classics
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: hako-os <hako@hako-os>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkgconf, libsdl3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hako-raylib-classics
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: raylib classic games for hako (raysan5/raylib-games classics)
 The twelve classic games of raysan5/raylib-games (Arkanoid, Asteroids, Floppy,
 Gold Fever, Gorilas, Missile Commander, Pang, Platformer, Snake, Space
 Invaders, Tetris and Asteroids Survival) in one app with a menu, playable with
 the built-in pad of a handheld and with touch (on-screen pad). raylib is built
 in statically from the hako-raylib-hello submodule. The licenses are shown
 from the menu. Registered in hako-launcher as "raylib クラシック".
